-An HTTP server that routes each request by the method and target in its request line.
+An HTTP server that reads request lines, headers, and Content-Length bodies before routing. Malformed or incomplete requests receive 400 Bad Request. Transfer-Encoding is not supported.
+
+Routes: `GET /`, `GET /users/:userId/posts/:postId`, and `/echo` (any method), which returns `METHOD /echo` as plain text.
+
+Test: `npm test`
 
 Run: `node server.js`
 
